{"task_id": "Mbpp/170", "solution": "def sum_range_list(numberList: list[float | int], startIndex: int, endIndex: int) -> float | int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of numbers in a list within a specified inclusive range.\n    Returns 0 if the list is empty or the range is invalid.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(numberList)\n\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    # Validate indices and range order\n    if not (0 <= startIndex < n and 0 <= endIndex < n and startIndex <= endIndex):\n        return 0\n\n    current_sum = 0\n    for i in range(startIndex, endIndex + 1):\n        current_sum += numberList[i]\n\n    return current_sum"}
