{"task_id": "Mbpp/172", "solution": "def count_occurance(input_string: str, target_substring: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of non-overlapping, case-sensitive occurrences\n    of a target substring within an input string.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_string or not target_substring:\n        return 0\n\n    count = 0\n    start_index = 0\n    while True:\n        idx = input_string.find(target_substring, start_index)\n        if idx == -1:\n            break\n        count += 1\n        start_index = idx + len(target_substring)\n\n    return count"}
