{"task_id": "Mbpp/265", "solution": "def list_split(input_list: list, n: int) -> list[list]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Splits an input list into 'n' sublists based on index modulo 'n' logic.\n    Elements from the input list are distributed into 'n' sublists such that\n    the element at index 'i' in the original list is placed into the sublist\n    at index 'i % n'.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_lists = [[] for _ in range(n)]\n\n    for i, item in enumerate(input_list):\n        target_sublist_index = i % n\n        result_lists[target_sublist_index].append(item)\n\n    return result_lists"}
