{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "def even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of binomial coefficients C(n, k) for all even k,\n    where k ranges from 0 to n.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int) or n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be a positive integer.\")\n\n    # The sum of even index binomial coefficients (C(n, 0) + C(n, 2) + ...)\n    # is given by the identity 2^(n-1) for n >= 1.\n    return 2**(n - 1)"}
