{"task_id": "Mbpp/296", "solution": "def get_Inv_Count(array: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts inversions in the input array and returns the total count.\n    An inversion occurs when i < j and array[i] > array[j].\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(array)\n    inv_count = 0\n    for i in range(n - 1):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if array[i] > array[j]:\n                inv_count += 1\n    return inv_count"}
