{"task_id": "Mbpp/299", "solution": "def max_aggregate(entries: list[tuple[str, int]]) -> tuple[str, int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum aggregate score from a list of name-score entries.\n    Returns ('', 0) if the input list is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    aggregated_scores = {}\n    for name, score in entries:\n        aggregated_scores[name] = aggregated_scores.get(name, 0) + score\n\n    if not aggregated_scores:\n        return ('', 0)\n\n    max_name = ''\n    max_score = 0\n    for name, score in aggregated_scores.items():\n        if score > max_score:\n            max_score = score\n            max_name = name\n    \n    return (max_name, max_score)"}
