{"task_id": "Mbpp/445", "solution": "def index_multiplication(tuple1: tuple[tuple[int, ...], ...], tuple2: tuple[tuple[int, ...], ...]) -> tuple[tuple[int, ...], ...]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Performs index-wise multiplication of elements from two input nested tuples.\n    Returns a new nested tuple with the results.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_outer_tuple = []\n    for inner_tuple1, inner_tuple2 in zip(tuple1, tuple2):\n        result_inner_tuple = []\n        for el1, el2 in zip(inner_tuple1, inner_tuple2):\n            result_inner_tuple.append(el1 * el2)\n        result_outer_tuple.append(tuple(result_inner_tuple))\n    return tuple(result_outer_tuple)"}
