{"task_id": "Mbpp/457", "solution": "def Find_Min(input_list_of_lists: list[list]) -> list | None:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sublist with the minimum length from a list of lists.\n    Returns None if input_list_of_lists is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_list_of_lists:\n        return None\n\n    min_sublist = input_list_of_lists[0]\n    min_length = len(min_sublist)\n\n    for sublist in input_list_of_lists:\n        current_sublist_length = len(sublist)\n        if current_sublist_length < min_length:\n            min_length = current_sublist_length\n            min_sublist = sublist\n            \n    return min_sublist"}
