{"task_id": "Mbpp/555", "solution": "def difference(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the difference between the sum of cubes and sum of natural numbers for the first n natural numbers.\n\n    Args:\n        n (int): A natural number (positive integer).\n\n    Returns:\n        int: The calculated difference.\n    \"\"\"\n    sum_of_cubes = (n * (n + 1) // 2) ** 2\n    sum_of_naturals = n * (n + 1) // 2\n    final_difference = sum_of_cubes - sum_of_naturals\n    return final_difference"}
