{"task_id": "Mbpp/556", "solution": "def find_Odd_Pair(input_list,N):\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts pairs of numbers from an input list where the bitwise XOR of the pair results in an odd value.\n    N parameter is ignored as the list length can be directly determined from input_list.\n    \"\"\"\n    odd_count = 0\n    even_count = 0\n\n    for number in input_list:\n        if number % 2 != 0:  # Check if number is odd\n            odd_count += 1\n        else:  # Number is even\n            even_count += 1\n\n    total_odd_xor_pairs = odd_count * even_count\n    return total_odd_xor_pairs"}
