{"task_id": "Mbpp/559", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum(numbers: list[int], length: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the largest contiguous sublist in the given list.\n    This implementation uses Kadane's algorithm.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not numbers:\n        return 0\n\n    max_so_far = numbers[0]\n    current_max = numbers[0]\n\n    for i in range(1, length):\n        current_max = max(numbers[i], current_max + numbers[i])\n        max_so_far = max(max_so_far, current_max)\n\n    return max_so_far"}
