{"task_id": "Mbpp/564", "solution": "def count_Pairs(integer_list: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of possible unordered pairs where both elements are unequal.\n\n    Iterates through all possible pairs and increments a counter if the elements are not equal.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    n = len(integer_list)\n\n    if n < 2:\n        return 0\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if integer_list[i] != integer_list[j]:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
