{"task_id": "Mbpp/566", "solution": "def sum_digits(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the digits of a non-negative integer.\n    Raises ValueError if the input number is negative.\"\"\"\n    if number < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input must be a non-negative integer\")\n    \n    total_sum = 0\n    # Handle the case of zero directly\n    if number == 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    while number > 0:\n        digit = number % 10\n        total_sum += digit\n        number //= 10\n    return total_sum"}
