{"task_id": "Mbpp/792", "solution": "def count_list(input_list: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of direct sub-lists within the given input list.\n    It iterates through the input and increments a counter for each element that is a list.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    for element in input_list:\n        if isinstance(element, list):\n            count += 1\n    return count"}
